      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As of the recent update to push AV3 into the Open Beta, a similar issue began happening to me as well. It seems that being crouched or prone before using Remeasure Avatar seems to set the viewpoint incorrectly.\nVideo: https://youtu.be/toN6aNBA8l8",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
