  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So i basically have a height changing menu option, that remeasures the avatar when the menu option is open and when i close the menu, as long as the menu is open the remeasure works as intended, but the moment i close the menu the head of the avatar goes down, viewpoint remains unchanged. So the viewpoint ends up being above the head of the avatar instead of inside like it should be.",
